From 7cd90b34cb7f5b0545d8adc042303838829a9224 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Connor Buchan <mikey@blindcomputing.org>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 17:50:03 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dma: mx3-ipu: add asynchronous display PIO interface

Add an explicitly locked, instance-based programmed-I/O API for the MX3 asynchronous display ports.

Keep command/data phase selection independent from the mapping bank, configure the initial Kindle DISP0 wiring, and reference-count the DI enable shared by SDC and PIO consumers.

Signed-off-by: Michael Connor Buchan <mikey@blindcomputing.org>
---
 drivers/dma/ipu/Makefile       |   2 +-
 drivers/dma/ipu/ipu_idmac.c    |  36 ++-
 drivers/dma/ipu/ipu_intern.h   |  31 ++-
 drivers/dma/ipu/mx3_ipu_di.c   | 413 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 include/linux/dma/mx3-ipu-di.h |  52 +++++
 5 files changed, 528 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/dma/ipu/mx3_ipu_di.c
 create mode 100644 include/linux/dma/mx3-ipu-di.h

